WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.400
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.534
We're hanging with our pal
Adam Sandler, who stars --

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:07.267
-That was nice of you.
Get them riled up again.

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:09.934
-No, come on. "Hustle."
Let's talk about this.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.100
Let's talk about "hustle."
-Right.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.601
-Congrats.
It's getting great reviews.

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:15.400
I love it because
it's almost like --

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.868
To me, it's almost like "Rocky"
for basketball.

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:19.567
-Yes.
It's Philly.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:21.000
We shot it in Philly.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.467
My heart's out to Philly
with the tragedy yesterday.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:28.534
It's terrible with the shooting.
And love to everyone in Philly.

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:31.400
But, yes, we had a great time
in Philadelphia.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.634
You guys know.

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:34.067
-The Roots know, exactly.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.100
The Roots are in --
They're in the soundtrack.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.167
-We got a great tune
of The Roots in there,

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:40.400
got a lot of good Philly music
in there.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.300
And they were so nice to us
while we were shooting

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.234
and they just treated us
like family, everybody there.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.434
So, thank you to Philly.

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:49.734
And then we also shot in Spain.

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:54.200
We went to Spain because
I discover this kid in Spain

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.267
and bring him back to,
you know, Philly

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.734
to try to get him into the NBA.

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:02.133
But I was telling Jimmy,
when I went there,

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.968
I was swimming in
the Mediterranean, right?

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:08.133
It's very salty,
the sea over there.

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.734
The Mediterranean's
got a lot of salt.

00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:11.234
So you float.
You float.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:13.868
You don't even have to try
to tread water, you just float.

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:16.801
So I'm floating around,
having a fun time floating.

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.300
Sandman just floating around.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.701
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:22.467
-I look up and I see a beach.

00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:24.167
And I start floating
closer to the beach.

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:25.901
Everybody's nude.

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:29.000
They're all feeling great
about themselves being nude.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.834
And no one even cares.
There's older people nude.

00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:34.567
Young -- Good --
People who look good,

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:36.767
people who don't
look so good nude.

00:01:36.767 --> 00:01:37.934
Everyone's nude.
They don't care.

00:01:37.934 --> 00:01:39.033
They just feel comfortable.

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:40.033
They're just like,
"It doesn't matter.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.534
This is me.
This is who I am.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.601
I'm going to be nude."

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:43.934
So I go, "You know what?
Let me do that.

00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:45.234
Let me try that.

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:47.067
I want to feel comfortable
and confident.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:48.934
And everyone
seems to be cool here.

00:01:48.934 --> 00:01:50.501
Let me do this."
So I'm swimming.

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:53.300
I stand up in the water.
I take my bathing suit off.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.601
I'm still underwater.

00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:56.901
I'm kind of slowly working up
the confidence.

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:59.000
I take my bathing suit off.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.601
And I'm, like, standing there.
I go, "I shouldn't do this."

00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:03.501
I'm like, "Someone's
going to take my picture

00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:04.934
and ruin my life.

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:08.033
Let me just stay underwater.
This was a mistake."

00:02:08.033 --> 00:02:09.100
And I'm looking
for my bathing suit.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.601
But because it's so salty,

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:15.634
the testicles and the --

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.167
They were, like, floating up,

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:20.901
so you can see them kind of
floating on top of the water

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:23.634
and the other thing -- the thing
attached to the testicle,

00:02:23.634 --> 00:02:26.868
on top of the testicles,
was floating around, too,

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:28.234
and I was flying
to push it down.

00:02:28.234 --> 00:02:30.501
It kept coming back up
and floating.

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:31.834
And then --

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:36.968
So there was
a Spanish seagull nearby.

00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:38.267
[ Rim shot ]

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:41.467
And the Spanish seagull,
I think,

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:44.434
it translated to the word,
"worm."

00:02:44.434 --> 00:02:47.334
And it starts coming towards me.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:49.667
And then one of the other
seagulls, "No, no, no worm.

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:51.000
No worm."
-No, no.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.934
-But then a third seagull goes,
"McDonald's French fry."

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:56.167
So they started coming at me.

00:02:56.167 --> 00:02:57.801
I gave it to them.

00:02:57.801 --> 00:02:59.801
I was a guest in their country.

00:02:59.801 --> 00:03:01.267
I said, "You have a good time."

00:03:01.267 --> 00:03:03.100
-That's what a gentleman does.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.234
You're a good man.
You're a gentleman.

00:03:05.234 --> 00:03:08.000
-That's how they raised me.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.868
-I love this movie.
It's so good.

00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:11.300
It's funny.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.234
And, you know, I have a friend.
His name's Milton Lee.

00:03:14.234 --> 00:03:15.734
He works for the Nets.
-Right, right.

00:03:15.734 --> 00:03:19.767
-And he's got eyes
that none of us have.

00:03:19.767 --> 00:03:22.501
He discovers talent.
He knows --

00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:25.300
And it's a long road.
-Oh, yeah, man.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.601
-You're so lucky if you
get to play in the NBA.

00:03:27.601 --> 00:03:30.167
-Oh, my God, the hard work
everybody puts in

00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:31.434
to get in the league.

00:03:31.434 --> 00:03:33.767
To be seen by the league
to get to the next step

00:03:33.767 --> 00:03:35.934
